<sect1 id="EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_GPIO_EX3_INTERRUPT_1autotoc_md252">
<title>Introduction</title>
<para>This example configures the device GPIOs through the sysconfig file. One GPIO output pin, and one GPIO input pin is configured. The example then configures the GPIO input pin to be the source of an external interrupt which toggles the GPIO output pin.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_GPIO_EX3_INTERRUPT_1autotoc_md253">
<title>External Connections</title>
